{
  "id": "28631_jissou",
  "headword": "{実装|じっそう}",
  "reading": "じっそう",
  "romaji": "jissou",
  "part_of_speech": "noun, suru verb",
  "gloss": "implementation; mounting; equipping",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "implementation; mounting; equipping",
      "explanation": "The act of building a feature into software or hardware so it actually functions. In a hardware context, it can also mean physically mounting a component. Frequently used as a する verb."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "28631_jissou_ex1",
      "japanese": "{新|あたら}しい{機能|きのう}を{実装|じっそう}した。",
      "english": "I implemented a new feature.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "28631_jissou_ex2",
      "japanese": "{次|つぎ}のアップデートでチャット{機能|きのう}が{実装|じっそう}される。",
      "english": "The chat feature will be implemented in the next update.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "28631_jissou_ex3",
      "japanese": "セキュリティ{対策|たいさく}の{実装|じっそう}には{時間|じかん}がかかる。",
      "english": "Implementing security measures takes time.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Core term in software engineering for actually building functionality, as opposed to just designing or specifying it.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {機能|きのう}を{実装|じっそう}する: to implement a feature\n- {実装|じっそう}{方法|ほうほう}: implementation method\n- {実装|じっそう}される: to be implemented\n- {実装|じっそう}{済|ず}み: already implemented\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {開発|かいはつ}: development — broader; includes design, coding, and testing\n- {搭載|とうさい}: equipping; loading — used more for hardware features built into a product",
